V stories, adding threesomes and generally turning it up a few notches!<br>The plot won\u2019t take away from the artwork and sex scenes, either. With new artists joining the ranks, expect a visual feast with even hotter still images and improved animations. The puzzle sections are getting upgrades as well with new level objectives, improved balance and better overall feel.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750200/extras/dfb932aefed31970ffba3227ffce268b.avif?t=1750756696\" /></div><br>The warm evening air outside is just wonderful, it smells like spring... and par-tay! Your friend Marcelle invites you out to their frat soiree and you are determined to find some good company for the evening. And maybe for the whole night, hmm?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750200/extras/dc15c4c06e994e71e806331fdc3041ef.avif?t=1750756696\" /></div><br>Wow! Elliott you crafty S.O.B! Finally you got brave enough to ask your gorgeous woman out! Ah, what an evening it\u2019s going to be! Candles, piano music, a fancy restaurant. Nothing is able to tear this dream date apart, not a pretty waiter nor the sudden arrival of a long-time-no-see girlfriend. <i>Isn\u2019t it, right?..</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750200/extras/7c0fd4a654147b131d345fc74c03c3dc.avif?t=1750756696\" /></div><br>\u201cCertainly not, mister! I am here but to clean your chambers!\u201d, she says.<br>\u201cIs that all you have come here for? What about\u2026 cleaning figurines?\u201d, he replies. <br>What an insufferable nerd! Anyway, he is so handsome and cute\u2026 Definitely worth a try! Cleaning services are <i>so boring</i>, after all.<br>She only needs to make her intentions obvious somehow. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn